Description: Test suite for QAT lib userspace package
Author: Vilem Marsik <vmarsik@redhat.com> and Denis Aleksandrov <daleksan@redhat.com>
Links:
- The Intel QAT configuration script is from
https://intel.github.io/quickassist/qatlib/configuration.html
- Idea for tests came from
https://intel.github.io/quickassist/qatlib/sample_code.html
README:
This test suite is meant to be run using the `bkr workflow-kernel` or `bkr workflow-tomorrow`
utility. At every run of the test suite, the QE must include the following:
--task <link to internal beaker-core-tasks#command task> --taskparam CMDS_TO_RUN="dnf install -y <link to qatlib test target package rpm>"
--task <link to internal beaker-core-tasks#command task> --taskparam CMDS_TO_RUN="dnf install -y --enablerepo='*' qatlib-devel nasm"
